OL,3,GFEATURESCNatural vision: how
OL,4,CAttenborough shaped the colourful
OL,5,Cfuture of British TV
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir David Attenborough's 100th birthday
OL,8,Flater this week will see huge
OL,9,Fcelebrations.
OL,11,FRightly they will focus on his
OL,12,Fcontribution to natural history
OL,13,Fbroadcasting and his concern for the
OL,14,Fenvironment and natural world.
OL,16,FBut his wider contribution to
OL,17,Fbroadcasting is worthy of attention
OL,18,Ftoo.
OL,20,FHe has one particular legacy ` the
OL,21,Fsuccessful launch and development of
OL,22,Fcolour television in Britain.
OL,23,APub: 03-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,123,120,200,300,0,100
